   "locked": false,
   "text": "44 px per meter. The cues sounding 54.00 to 76.00 s, each labelled with its onset; steps with their contact times, each walker's on the side away from the other's prints. Listeners, rings and shading as on the main map.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "44 px per meter. The cues sounding 54.00 to 76.00 s, each labelled with its onset; steps with their contact times, each walker's on the side away from the other's prints. Listeners, rings and shading as on the main map.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
